        }
      ],
      "en": "Moses said, “We will go with our young and with our old. We will go with our sons and with our daughters, with our flocks and with our herds; for we must hold a feast to the LORD.”",
      "ko": "모세가 가로되 우리가 여호와 앞에 절기를 지킬것인즉 우리가 남녀 노소와 우양을 데리고 가겠나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "40307bbcc30f11acc078cb90dca6618cff259a99d336e8bcf27cd364790791bf",
      "translation_text_hash": "13c339b7c04643c42df94746d55087bdd93ad7c1de550929c30c8a90bbd13f7b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
