      ],
      "en": "The locusts went up over all the land of Egypt, and rested in all the borders of Egypt. They were very grievous. Before them there were no such locusts as they, nor will there ever be again.",
      "ko": "메뚜기가 애굽 온 땅에 이르러 그 사방에 내리매 그 해가 심하니 이런 메뚜기는 전에도 없었고 후에도 없을러라",
      "source_text_hash": "07800c804c453a19318d094925f71284e7f7413a9cfe2fed3db044ec8f0caf0e",
      "translation_text_hash": "8fbf49a026c20b76d79fe20b103afce0a061f1f51005498189f76bf43f403c0f",
