      "en": "Then Pharaoh called for Moses and Aaron in haste, and he said, “I have sinned against the LORD your God, and against you.",
      "ko": "바로가 모세와 아론을 급히 불러서 이르되 내가 너희 하나님 여호와와 너희에게 득죄하였으니",
      "source_text_hash": "aae0a2a0682e62cf83f24a91af1e432dc0f5e68092238d38ad9cfe36c496c25d",
