      "en": "Moses stretched out his hand toward the sky, and there was a thick darkness in all the land of Egypt for three days.",
      "ko": "모세가 하늘을 향하여 손을 들매 캄캄한 흑암이 삼일 동안 애굽 온 땅에 있어서",
      "source_text_hash": "c7b628110264ebf2a8810acd714c1ee7c0942288369ec572f9cec5b269b8d022",
      "translation_text_hash": "b5e242d64bbe51cb6d34aa69aebae1d468173cc9b9b39fa188d86a0c1587d0ba",
